{"id":"4c908091e8e31a3b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-modal-language.md","title":"The Modal Language and Letterless Sentences","display":"df-modal-language — The Modal Language and Letterless Sentences","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-modal-language","aliases":["92-df-modal-language"],"display":"df-modal-language — The Modal Language and Letterless Sentences","source":"第 XI 章 pp. 132、134（PDF 149、151）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-modal-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-modal-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-language — The Modal Language and Letterless Sentences"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 pp. 132、134（PDF 149、151）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>）为互异的命题变量 token；另有原书的五个 token <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box,\\supset,\\bot,\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\">\\(\\Box,\\supset,\\bot,\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>以下运算是有限字符串构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box},\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box},\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 为新定义的集合/函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}language}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{\\Box,\\supset,\\bot,\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box}(F,H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathtt{(}F\\supset H\\mathtt{)},&amp;\n\\operatorname{box}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\Sigma_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}:\\{\\bot\\}\\cup\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box}(F,H),\\operatorname{box}(F)\\in U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&amp;\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(p_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p_i\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F\\supset H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(H),&amp;\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(\\Box F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F)=\\varnothing\\},&amp;\n\\neg_{\\Box}F&amp;\\coloneqq F\\supset\\bot.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}language}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{\\Box,\\supset,\\bot,\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box}(F,H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathtt{(}F\\supset H\\mathtt{)},&amp;\n\\operatorname{box}(F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\Sigma_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}:\\{\\bot\\}\\cup\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box}(F,H),\\operatorname{box}(F)\\in U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&amp;\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(p_i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{p_i\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F\\supset H)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(H),&amp;\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(\\Box F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F)=\\varnothing\\},&amp;\n\\neg_{\\Box}F&amp;\\coloneqq F\\supset\\bot.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>最小闭包存在，有限语法树给出 PV 的结构递归。其它命题联结词按否定/蕴涵展开，不是新增 token。</p>\n<p>本节的 sentence 专指不含命题变量的 letterless formula；上一节抽象可证系统的 sentence 则可指任意元素，两者范围不同。LF 对蕴涵、否定和 Box 封闭，不能在自指真值中悄悄加入未赋值的命题变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"p_i","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box,\\supset,\\bot,\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box},\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}language}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Sigma_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\cup\\{\\Box,\\supset,\\bot,\\mathtt{(},\\mathtt{)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box}(F,H)&\\coloneqq\\mathtt{(}F\\supset H\\mathtt{)},&\n\\operatorname{box}(F)&\\coloneqq\\Box F,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\Sigma_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}:\\{\\bot\\}\\cup\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\subseteq U,\\\n\\forall F,H\\in U\\;\\operatorname{imp}_{\\Box}(F,H),\\operatorname{box}(F)\\in U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(\\bot)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(p_i)&\\coloneqq\\{p_i\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F\\supset H)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(H),&\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(\\Box F)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}&\\coloneqq\\{F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}:\\operatorname{PV}_{\\Box}(F)=\\varnothing\\},&\n\\neg_{\\Box}F&\\coloneqq F\\supset\\bot.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2021,"backlinks":[{"id":"4339a848b5e63fc1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2cf611da381080e0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f403c224ddb070f8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}$ 分别为 [[92-df-modal-language]] 的公式域和 letterless 域。"},{"id":"e69e849d9714457a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7d011f131f5a8d4d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LF}_{\\Box}$ 是 [[92-df-modal-language]] 中不含命题变量的公式集。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-language]] → [[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]] → [[92-df-modal-associated-system]] → [[92-prop-modal-system-types]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-language]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-language]]"}],"outgoing":[]}